@startuml
!include _style.iuml

[*] --> Draft : create audit
Draft --> InProgress : first response saved
InProgress --> InProgress : answer / measure / capture
InProgress --> Closed : close (all items resolved\nor explicitly deferred)
Closed --> InProgress : reopen (lead only,\nlogged)
Closed --> Syncing : connectivity available
Syncing --> Synced : structured data + imagery uploaded
Syncing --> Closed : interrupted (resumable)
Synced --> UnderReview : draft report generated
UnderReview --> UnderReview : edit recommendation
UnderReview --> Synced : return for re-survey
UnderReview --> Approved : named sign-off
Approved --> Issued : report exported
Issued --> [*]

Approved : responses locked
Issued : version immutable

note right of Closed
  Closure requires every item to be
  PASS, FAIL, NA or UNABLE.
  Deferred items are listed and
  must be acknowledged.
end note

note right of Approved
  Any later change produces a
  new report version; the prior
  version is retained.
end note
@enduml
